OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloud and
OL,6,Fpatchy rain soon clearing the
OL,7,Fsoutheast this evening, allow mostly
OL,8,Fdry and increasingly clear conditions
OL,9,Fto spread south across all areas
OL,10,Fthrough the evening. Chance of the odd
OL,11,Flight shower towards the north coast.
OL,12,
OL,13,CMonday:FA mainly dry and bright day
OL,14,Fwith warm sunny spells, although the
OL,15,Fsunshine will occasionally turn hazy
OL,16,Fduring the afternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
