OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FA
OL,6,Fwarm or very warm period with a good
OL,7,Fdeal of dry and bright weather. Dry on
OL,8,FTuesday. Just the risk of a few
OL,9,Fshowers on Wednesday and Thursday.
